{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039750/extras/a6406688a3f90b7c4d7d0d63dba34e4d.avif?t=1758447753\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prince of Darkness Jr.</strong> is a block-pushing puzzle game where you can't step into the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squatters are moving into Castle Darkness and turning on all the old gas lamps. It's up to the young Prince to get around the castle and stop them from taking over his home!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>complete first world</strong> of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 puzzles</strong> + <strong>hidden secrets</strong> to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push blocks, cast shadows, unlock doors, find secrets</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full game includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 worlds with <strong>over 200 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New exciting mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extended soundtrack and more cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039750/extras/910f8178737bf7775eeb456f31726f9c.avif?t=1758447753\" width=1073 height=891 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created as part of the 1-Bit Game Jam 2023.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039750?t=1758447753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039750/89bfe25904e606265e70c85571af363f30b44da9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758447753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item